WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
All right. Now, right hand goes to the left toe. Keep your knee straight. And stretch.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:23.000
One, two, three, four, up. And attack. One, two, three, four, five. One more time.

3
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:37.000
A little bit harder. One, two, three, four, five. The other side. One, two, three, four, five.

4
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Okay. Now, we'll stretch the side. As low as we can. One, two, three, four, five.

5
00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:00.000
The other side. One, two, three, four, five.
